@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"

Feature: WWW Customers
	Frontend testing for the www customers

Scenario: Customers Homepage Navigation
	End users should be able to view all links in the developers homepage.

	Given I go to the www page with the url "customers"
	Then there should be no errors on the page
    When I click on the "Customer Portal" card on the customers homepage
    Then there should be no errors on the page
	And the current url content should not contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com"
	When I go to the www page with the url "customers"
    And I click on the "Customer Onboarding Journey" card on the customers homepage
    Then there should be no errors on the page
	And the current url content should not contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com"
    When I go to the www page with the url "customers"
    And I click on the "Documentation" card on the customers homepage
    Then there should be no errors on the page
	And the current url content should not contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com"
    When I go to the www page with the url "customers"
    And I click on the "Learning" card on the customers homepage
    Then there should be no errors on the page
	And the current url content should not contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com"
    When I go to the www page with the url "customers"
    And I click on the "Partner Directory" card on the customers homepage
    Then there should be no errors on the page
	And the current url content should not contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com"
    When I go to the www page with the url "customers"
    And I click on the "Marketplace" card on the customers homepage
    Then there should be no errors on the page
	And the current url content should not contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com"

Scenario: View OG Tags in Customers page
	The customers page og tags should be specific values.

	Given I go to the www page with the url "customers"
	Then the current page og title tag should be "Liferay Customer Resources"
	And the current page og description tag should be "A collection of all the resources to be successful with Liferay including documentation, onboarding, customer portal, partner directory, education, and marketplace"
	And the current page og url tag should be "https://www-uat.liferay.com/customers"
	And the current page og image tag should be "https://www-uat.liferay.com/documents/10182/0/open_graph_image+%281%29.png/a608e357-83f6-e392-979c-6599a8618634/open_graph_image+%281%29.png?version=1.0&t=1646949040894&imagePreview=1"